    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "NUM 11:28 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Joshua the son of Nun, the servant of Moses, one of his chosen men, answered, “My lord Moses, forbid them!”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 13:8 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Of the tribe of Ephraim, Hoshea the son of Nun."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 13:16 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "These are the names of the men who Moses sent to spy out the land. Moses called Hoshea the son of Nun Joshua."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 14:6 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Joshua the son of Nun and Caleb the son of Jephunneh, who were of those who spied out the land, tore their clothes."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 14:30 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "surely you shall not come into the land concerning which I swore that I would make you dwell therein, except Caleb the son of Jephunneh, and Joshua the son of Nun."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 14:38 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "But Joshua the son of Nun and Caleb the son of Jephunneh remained alive of those men who went to spy out the land."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 26:65 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "For the LORD had said of them, “They shall surely die in the wilderness.” There was not a man left of them, except Caleb the son of Jephunneh, and Joshua the son of Nun."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 27:18 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "The LORD said to Moses, “Take Joshua the son of Nun, a man in whom is the Spirit, and lay your hand on him."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 27:22 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses did as the LORD commanded him. He took Joshua, and set him before Eleazar the priest and before all the congregation."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:12 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "except Caleb the son of Jephunneh the Kenizzite, and Joshua the son of Nun, because they have followed the LORD completely.’"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:28 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "So Moses commanded concerning them to Eleazar the priest, and to Joshua the son of Nun, and to the heads of the fathers’ households of the tribes of the children of Israel."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 34:17 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "“These are the names of the men who shall divide the land to you for inheritance: Eleazar the priest, and Joshua the son of Nun."
      }
    ],
